00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,366
Beyond the Cards is an interactive tarot learning and storytelling experience.
From the

2
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:08,731
art of the cards to the story of you. Instead of simply receiving

3
00:00:08,731 --> 00:00:13,097
